        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:MONDO_0005416</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Noninflammatory degenerative disease of the knee joint consisting of three large categories: conditions that block normal synchronous movement, conditions that produce abnormal pathways of motion, and conditions that cause stress concentration resulting in changes to articular cartilage. (Crenshaw, Campbell&apos;s Operative Orthopaedics, 8th ed, p2019)</Literal>
