        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000115"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:MONDO_0007028</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Tear of one or more of the tendons of the four rotator cuff muscles of the shoulder. A rotator cuff &apos;injury&apos; can include any type of irritation or overuse of those muscles or tendons, and is among the most common conditions affecting the shoulder.</Literal>
