    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:UBPROP_0000010"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:UBERON_0000970</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Note that whilst this is classified as an organ, it is in fact more of a unit composed of different structures: in Drosophila, it includes the interommatidial bristle as a part; we consider here the vertebrate eye to include the eyeball/eye proper as a part, with the eye having as parts (when present): eyelids, conjuctiva,</Literal>
