    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:UBPROP_0000001"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:UBERON_0001424</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>One of the two long bones of endochondral origin of the fore-epipodium; it is located on the medial (inner) side of the radius. The upper end of the ulna articulates with the lower end of the humerus forming a strong hinge joint with the carpals, whereas the lower articulates with the carpals.[AAO]</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
