        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000116"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:UBERON_0001981</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>consider adopting the EMAPA superclass &apos;vascular element&apos;, which includes microvasculature (e.g. capillaries), vascular plexus</Literal>
