        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:UBPROP_0000001"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:UBERON_0002217</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Is a joint that is located at the point of contact of articulating bones allowing movement. The joint has a capsule containing synovial fluid surrounding the articulating bone surfaces.[TAO]</Literal>
