        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:UBERON_0002225</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>The costal margin, sometimes referred to as the costal arch, is the medial margin formed by the false ribs, which in humans is from the eighth rib to the tenth rib.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
