        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:UBERON_0002514</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>[In TAO], This term was made obsolete because it is considered a synonym of membrane bone (VSAO:0000023).[TAO]</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
