        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000115"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:UBERON_0003681</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>In humans: Muscles arising in the zygomatic arch that close the jaw. Their nerve supply is masseteric from the mandibular division of the trigeminal nerve. (From Stedman, 25th ed).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000232"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:UBERON_0003681</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>we use this specifically for a jaw muscle that is innervates by the mandibular nerve.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
