        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:UBERON_0011575</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>The styloid process of the ulna projects from the medial and back part of the bone; it descends a little lower than the head, and its rounded end affords attachment to the ulnar collateral ligament of the wrist[WP,unvetted].</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
