        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000115"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:UBERON_0011676</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>A major subdivision of an organism that divides an organism along its main body axis (typically anterio-posterior axis). In vertebrates, this is based on the vertebral column.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000116"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:UBERON_0011676</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Ideally this would be disjoint with analagous class for appendicular axes, but currently &apos;appendages&apos; like antennae, horns cause a problem</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
