        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:UBPROP_0000107</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>x vertebra_number N if and only if (i) x is a vertebra, and (ii) x is vertebra number N in a series of vertebras repeated along an anterior-posterior axis, with vertebra_number 1 being the anteriormost vertebra (also known as the atlas).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
