    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/tara/external/unclassified_imported_term</IRI>
        <Literal>This class is used as a generic &quot;placeholder&quot; superclass for all the unclassified imported terms used by some of the asserted axioms of the TARA Acupoints ontology and its knowledgebase. The subclasses of this class are the related terms imported from UBERON, MONDO, and HP ontologies. 

Note 1: Each subclass of this class reuse the exact same IRI and label from the external ontologies without any logical axioms.This choice was made to avoid importing the massive ontologies like UBERON, MONDO, and HP, while keeping the labels only for the related axiomatic terms. This allows avoiding the reasoning overhead for the core TARA ontology classes.

Note 2: The actual classification and the axioms of the terms under this class should be readily available to query by loading the external ontologies into a high-performance graph database (e.g., Stardog or GraphDB) along with TARA Acupoints ontology.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/tara/external/unclassified_imported_term</IRI>
        <Literal>unclassified imported term</Literal>
