        <IRI>http://uri.interlex.org/base/ilx_0795318</IRI>
        <Literal>The long bone in the hand that connects the fourth finger to the carpal bones of the wrist. The fourth metacarpal bone is shorter and smaller than the third. The base is small and quadrilateral.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
