        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_2990862</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Superficially, the transverse facial artery and vein; in the deepest layer, the maxillary artery and maxillary vein.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
