    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasIndicationsDescription"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_3496812</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Cough, pain in the chest, asthma, hemoptysis, sore throat, spasmodic pain of the elbow and arm.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasInnervationDescription"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_3496812</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>The lateral antebrachial cutaneous nerve and the superficial ramus of the radial nerve.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasLocationalDescription"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_3496812</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>On the anterolateral aspect of the forearm, on the line connecting LU5 with LU9, 7 B- cun superior to the palmar wrist crease. 
Note: LU6 is 5 B-cun inferior to LU5, 1 B-cun superior to the midpoint of the line connecting LU5 with LU9.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasMeridian"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_3496812</AbbreviatedIRI>
