        <Literal>Source for the Acupoint Location: WHO Standard Acupuncture Point Locations in the Western Pacific Region. World Health Organization. Regional Office for the Western Pacific, 2008. Page 212. ISBN 978-92-9061-248-7.

Source for Acupuncture Method, Vasculature, Innervation, and Indications:
D. Liangyue, G. Yijun, H. Shuhui, et al. Chinese Acupuncture and Moxibustion. Revised ed. Beijing: Foreign Languages Press; 1999. Chapter 10, Acupuncture Points of the Governor and the Conception Vessels and the Extra Points. ISBN 978-7-119-01758-7.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasChineseLabel"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_7589061</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>強間(间)</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasIndicationsDescription"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_7589061</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Headache, neck rigidity, blurring of vision, mania.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasLocationalDescription"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_7589061</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>On the head, 4 B-cun superior to the posterior hairline, on the posterior median line. Note: GV18 is located in the depression 1.5 B-cun superior to gV17.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasMeridian"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_7589061</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_0386099</AbbreviatedIRI>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasMethodDescription"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_7589061</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Puncture subcutaneously 0.3-0.5 inch. Moxibustion is applicable.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasPinyinLabel"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_7589061</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Qiangjian</Literal>
