        <Literal>In the anterior thoracic region, in the fifth intercostal space, 4 B-cun lateral to the anterior median line. Note: In males, ST 18 is located at the intersection of nipple line and the fifth intercostal space. In females, ST 18 is located at the midpoint of the inferior crease of the breast.</Literal>
