    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dcterms:bibliographicCitation"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_8087484</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Source for the Acupoint Location: WHO Standard Acupuncture Point Locations in the Western Pacific Region. World Health Organization. Regional Office for the Western Pacific, 2008. Page 43. ISBN 978-92-9061-248-7.

Source for Acupuncture Method, Vasculature, Innervation, and Indications:
D. Liangyue, G. Yijun, H. Shuhui, et al. Chinese Acupuncture and Moxibustion. Revised ed. Beijing: Foreign Languages Press; 1999. Chapter 7, Acupuncture Points of the Taiyin and Yangming Meridian. ISBN 978-7-119-01758-7.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasChineseLabel"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_8087484</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>口禾髎(髎)</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasIndicationsDescription"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_8087484</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Nasal obstruction, epistaxis, deviation of the mouth.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasInnervationDescription"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_8087484</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>The anastomotic branch of the facial nerve and the infraorbital nerve.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasLocationalDescription"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_8087484</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>On the face, at the same level as the midpoint of the philtrum, inferior to the lateral margin of the nostril. Note: 0.5 B-cun laterals to GV 26. Remarks: Alternative location for LI19 - On the face, at the same level as the junc- tion of the upper one third and lower two thirds of the philtrum, inferior to the lateral margin of the nostril.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasMeridian"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_8087484</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_4610474</AbbreviatedIRI>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasMethodDescription"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_8087484</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Puncture obliquely 0.2-0.3 inch.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasPinyinLabel"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_8087484</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Kouheliao</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
