        <Literal>Source for the Acupoint Location: WHO Standard Acupuncture Point Locations in the Western Pacific Region. World Health Organization. Regional Office for the Western Pacific, 2008. Page 37. ISBN 978-92-9061-248-7.

Source for Acupuncture Method, Vasculature, Innervation, and Indications:
D. Liangyue, G. Yijun, H. Shuhui, et al. Chinese Acupuncture and Moxibustion. Revised ed. Beijing: Foreign Languages Press; 1999. Chapter 7, Acupuncture Points of the Taiyin and Yangming Meridian. ISBN 978-7-119-01758-7.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasChineseLabel"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_8455793</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>下廉</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasIndicationsDescription"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_8455793</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Abdominal pain, borborygmus, pain in the elbow and arm, motor impairment of the upper limbs.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasLocationalDescription"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_8455793</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>On the posterolateral aspect of the forearm, on the line connecting LI5 with LI11, 4 B- cun inferior to the cubital crease. Note: LI8 is located at the junction of the upper one third and lower two thirds of the line connecting LI5 with LI11, 1 B-cun inferior to LI9.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasMeridian"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_8455793</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_4610474</AbbreviatedIRI>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasMethodDescription"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_8455793</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Puncture perpendicularly 0.5-1.0 inch. Moxibustion is applicable.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="TARA:hasPinyinLabel"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>TARA:TARA_8455793</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Xialian</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
